    <!-- First-launch tip dialog (shown once on first app entry) -->
    <string name="backup_tip_title">⚠️ Two things to set up in Settings</string>
    <string name="backup_tip_message">Before you start adding entries, take a moment to protect your data:\n\n🔐  Security Question\nGo to Settings → Security Question. This is the only way to recover access if you forget your PIN.\n\n💾  Create a Backup\nGo to Settings → Export Backup. Save the backup file to Google Drive or any cloud storage. Turn on Auto-Backup so it stays up to date.\n\nWithout these, a forgotten PIN or lost device means your data is gone forever.</string>
